    "answer": {
      "short": "$a=2$, $b=3$, $c=4$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}aP(x)+bQ(x)+cR(x)&=a(x+1)+b(x+x^2)+c(x^2+x^3)\\\\aP(x)+bQ(x)+cR(x)&=cx^3+(b+c)x^2+(a+b)x+a\\end{align*}$$\n\nEquating coefficients gives $a=2$, $a+b=5$, $b+c=7$ and $c=4$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}b&=5-2\\\\b&=3\\\\b+c&=3+4=7\\end{align*}$$\n\nThus $a=2$, $b=3$ and $c=4$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
